    "内置卷清理前自动创建本地快照，误删可整体回滚；快照由系统按需自动回收。外置卷的系统机制不可用，仍以废纸篓为回滚保障。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before cleaning, a local APFS snapshot is created on the internal disk so mistakes can be rolled back; the system reclaims snapshots as needed. External disks lack this system mechanism — Trash remains the rollback guarantee there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
